n roadmap.  File paths are relative to repository root.\\n\\n0. PREREQUISITES\\n   • Node 18+  • npm 9+  • Git  • Vercel CLI  • Firebase CLI  • jq (for scripts)\\n   • Two Firebase projects already reserved: hoa-portal-dev, hoa-portal-prod.\\n   • Vercel account with GitHub linkage.\\n\\n1. INITIAL REPOSITORY & TOOLING\\n   1.1  npx create-next-app@latest hoa-portal --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --no-src-dir --import-alias \\\"@/*\\\"\\n   1.2  cd hoa-portal && git init && git remote add origin <repo-url>\\n   1.3  npm i firebase @firebase/auth @firebase/firestore @firebase/storage\\n   1.4  npm i @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/extension-markdown marked react-use clsx\\n   1.5  npm i -D jest @testing-library/react axe-playwright @playwright/test\\n\\n2. GLOBAL STRUCTURE (App Router)\\n   app/\\n     layout.tsx              // Root providers\\n     globals.css             // Tailwind base\\n     (public)/…              // see §2.1\\n     (member)/…              // see §2.2\\n     (admin)/…               // see §2.3\\n     not-found.tsx\\n   middleware.ts             // Edge auth/role gate (§3)\\n   components/, context/, hooks/, lib/, types/, tailwind.config.js\\n\\n   2.1 PUBLIC SEGMENT FILES (one file each)\\n       (public)/layout.tsx, page.tsx, contact/page.tsx, bylaws/page.tsx,\\n       schools/page.tsx, login/page.tsx\\n   2.2 MEMBER SEGMENT FILES\\n       (member)/layout.tsx, dues/page.tsx, meetings/page.tsx,\\n       meetings/[year]/page.tsx, news-events/page.tsx,\\n       news-events/[slug]/page.tsx\\n   2.3 ADMIN SEGMENT FILES\\n       (admin)/layout.tsx, dashboard/page.tsx (+ sidebar components)\\n\\n3. AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY IMPLEMENTATION\\n   3.1  firebase.json, .firebaserc → alias dev/prod projectIds.\\n   3.2  src/lib/firebaseClient.ts – initialise SDK with env vars.\\n   3.3  src/lib/firebaseAdmin.ts  – Admin SDK w/ credential cache.\\n   3.4  context/AuthContext.tsx & hooks/useAuth.ts – client auth state.\\n   3.5  middleware.ts – edge JWT verification; matcher:[\\\"/(member)(.*)\\\",\\\"/(admin)(.*)\\\"]\\n   3.6  functions/ (using Firebase Functions v2)\\n        • auth/onCreate.ts – default resident role claim.\\n        • https/setRole.ts – callable only by admin.\\n   3.7  firestore.rules & storage.rules – copy from Auth DEP §E, F.\\n   3.8  scripts/set-remote-config.ts – toggle socialAuthEnabled param.\\n\\n4. CONTENT-MANAGEMENT / ADMIN DASHBOARD\\n   4.1  components/editor/RichTextEditor.tsx – Tiptap wrapper.\\n   4.2  hooks/useFirestoreDoc.ts, useUpload.ts – CRUD helpers.\\n   4.3  app/(admin)/news/* pages – list, new, [id].\\n        app/(admin)/minutes/*, financial reports, bylaws, schools editors.\\n   4.4  Storage upload paths: minutes/{docId}/{file}, financial-reports/{year}/{docId}.{ext}\\n   4.5  app/api/revalidate/route.ts – triggers ISR for affected paths.\\n\\n5. FRONTEND UI & THEMING\\n   5.1  components/layout/Header.tsx, Footer.tsx, MobileMenu.tsx\\n   5.2  Tailwind theme extension in tailwind.config.js (brand colours etc.).\\n   5.3  Responsive nav logic (useBreakpoint).  Mobile ≤768px hamburger.\\n   5.4  Accessibility: add skip-link, focus outlines, contrast tests (axe).\\n\\n6. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES\\n   .env.local.sample containing:\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_REMOTE_CONFIG_DEFAULTS='{\\\"socialAuthEnabled\\\":false}'\\n     COOKIE_SECRET_SIGNING=\\n     FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY_JSON=\\n   • Add same (encrypted) in Vercel for dev & prod.\\n\\n7. QUALITY & TESTS\\n   • ESLint/Prettier pre-commit via Husky.\\n   • jest + @testing-library for unit tests of components.\\n   • Playwright a11y test running axe-core on key pages.\\n   • GitHub Actions CI: lint, type-check, test, build.\\n\\n8. DEPLOYMENT PIPELINE\\n   8.1  vercel link –project \\\"hoa-portal\\\" –yes\\n   8.2  vercel env pull .env.local\\n   8.3  git push origin main → triggers Vercel build & preview URL.\\n   8.4  On merge to main, Vercel promotes to Production.\\n   8.5  firebase deploy --only firestore:rules,storage:rules,functions --project hoa-portal-prod (run from CI).\\n\\n9. EXECUTION-PHASE WORK PACKAGE LIST (OFAAT)\\n   Supervisor-Frontend\\n     • S1 Layout & Navigation (root, public, member, admin layouts + Header/Footer)\\n     • S2 Public Pages\\n     • S3 Member Pages\\n   Supervisor-AdminCMS\\n     • S4 Admin Dashboard pages + RichTextEditor + upload services\\n     • S5 ISR & revalidate API route\\n   Supervisor-AuthSec\\n     • S6 middleware.ts, Auth context/hook, firebase client/admin libs\\n     • S7 Firestore & Storage rules, Cloud Functions, remote-config script\\n   Supervisor-Infra\\n     • S8 Firebase project CLI setup, env vars, GitHub/Vercel secrets\\n     • S9 CI pipeline YAML, lint/test workflows\\n   Supervisor-QA/Accessibility\\n     • S10 Unit tests, axe Playwright suite\\n\\n10. COMPLETION CRITERIA (Definition of Done)\\n   ✓ Build passes locally & in CI (tsc, eslint, jest).\\n   ✓ Visiting /dues unauth redirects to /login.\\n   ✓ Resident can view /news-events; boardMember can access /admin/*.\\n   ✓ Admin can create News item; public page shows within ≤1 h or on revalidate.\\n   ✓ Firebase rules dry-run passes with zero violations.\\n   ✓ Lighthouse score ≥90 and axe-core reports zero critical issues.\\n   ✓ Production deployed on Vercel and domain mapped.\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nEND OF MASTER DEP\\n---END DEP---\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}","genkit:output":"{\"candidates\":[{\"index\":0,\"message\":{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"APPROVE\"}]},\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"custom\":{}}],\"custom\":{\"candidates\":[{\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"APPROVE\"}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}],\"usageMetadata\":{\