e.tsx, login/page.tsx\\n   2.2 MEMBER SEGMENT FILES\\n       (member)/layout.tsx, dues/page.tsx, meetings/page.tsx,\\n       meetings/[year]/page.tsx, news-events/page.tsx,\\n       news-events/[slug]/page.tsx\\n   2.3 ADMIN SEGMENT FILES\\n       (admin)/layout.tsx, dashboard/page.tsx (+ sidebar components)\\n\\n3. AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY IMPLEMENTATION\\n   3.1  firebase.json, .firebaserc → alias dev/prod projectIds.\\n   3.2  src/lib/firebaseClient.ts – initialise SDK with env vars.\\n   3.3  src/lib/firebaseAdmin.ts  – Admin SDK w/ credential cache.\\n   3.4  context/AuthContext.tsx & hooks/useAuth.ts – client auth state.\\n   3.5  middleware.ts – edge JWT verification; matcher:[\\\"/(member)(.*)\\\",\\\"/(admin)(.*)\\\"]\\n   3.6  functions/ (using Firebase Functions v2)\\n        • auth/onCreate.ts – default resident role claim.\\n        • https/setRole.ts – callable only by admin.\\n   3.7  firestore.rules & storage.rules – copy from Auth DEP §E, F.\\n   3.8  scripts/set-remote-config.ts – toggle socialAuthEnabled param.\\n\\n4. CONTENT-MANAGEMENT / ADMIN DASHBOARD\\n   4.1  components/editor/RichTextEditor.tsx – Tiptap wrapper.\\n   4.2  hooks/useFirestoreDoc.ts, useUpload.ts – CRUD helpers.\\n   4.3  app/(admin)/news/* pages – list, new, [id].\\n        app/(admin)/minutes/*, financial reports, bylaws, schools editors.\\n   4.4  Storage upload paths: minutes/{docId}/{file}, financial-reports/{year}/{docId}.{ext}\\n   4.5  app/api/revalidate/route.ts – triggers ISR for affected paths.\\n\\n5. FRONTEND UI & THEMING\\n   5.1  components/layout/Header.tsx, Footer.tsx, MobileMenu.tsx\\n   5.2  Tailwind theme extension in tailwind.config.js (brand colours etc.).\\n   5.3  Responsive nav logic (useBreakpoint).  Mobile ≤768px hamburger.\\n   5.4  Accessibility: add skip-link, focus outlines, contrast tests (axe).\\n\\n6. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES\\n   .env.local.sample containing:\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=\\n     NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=\\n     N